# Ordering API (Minimal API endpoints, formerly OrderingController).
# Every route, binding and response matches the former controller; see SPEC.md.
# Note: these call the configured database. Mutating requests change data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accept = application/json, text/plain, */*

# --- Orders and scheduling ---

### GetAllListofOrders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Ordering/GetAllListofOrders?farms=Farm%20A
Accept: {{accept}}

### EditOrderQuantity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Ordering/EditOrderQuantity
Accept: {{accept}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "farmName": "Farm A", "farmCode": "F01", "itemCode": "RM-001", "uom": "KG", "quantityOrdered": 10.5, "orderDate": "2024-01-02T00:00:00", "dateNeeded": "2024-01-05T00:00:00"}

### SchedulePreparedOrderedDate
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Ordering/SchedulePreparedOrderedDate
Accept: {{accept}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"id": 1, "farmName": "Farm A", "farmCode": "F01", "itemCode": "RM-001", "uom": "KG", "quantityOrdered": 10.5, "orderDate": "2024-01-02T00:00:00", "dateNeeded": "2024-01-05T00:00:00"}]

